select-workspace-and-never-by-default

Lane: cross

Unit: default-to-workspace-with-never-approval

ChildPatch: select-workspace-and-never-by-default

Form: GitDiff

Segment: snapshot

Purpose: Default to the built-in Workspace profile with Never approval, with matching permission choices and status.

Requires: Unit:cross/configure-workspace-roots-from-project-directory, Unit:cross/enable-network-for-workspace-profiles

Provides: Select Never and built-in Workspace when unset regardless of project trust or projectless TUI entrypoint; retain explicit server and launch approval choices; offer the sandboxed Never choice and present approval consistently in permission menus, status and setup previews.

Boundary: Filesystem roots and project-directory preparation remain with configure-workspace-roots-from-project-directory, and the Workspace network default remains with enable-network-for-workspace-profiles. Explicit policies including Granular, managed restrictions, restored task settings, read-only profiles and trust-controlled configuration and hooks retain their behavior. Full Access retains confirmation and keyboard cycle ordering remains separate.

Verification: Core tests cover unset defaults, explicit settings and managed restrictions. TUI startup, new-session, directory-change and agents-overview tests verify Never through thread/start while preserving explicit server and launch policies and saved resume settings. Permission menus, status and preview tests verify the Never choice. Prompt-caching coverage retains a real permission transition and exact cached-prefix assertions.

CrossGroup: workspace-permissions


